"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAABv27_IB6XNws2YWnymG3JUkdNf55NkkoJU,NAME_SEARCH,avNU",Yasmeen Shaikh,Yasmeen,Shaikh,UOB,Cloud Data Engineer | Data Management & Analytics,,,,"Senior Data Engineer with 10+ years of experience designing, building, and supporting enterprise data pipelines, data integration solutions, and cloud data platforms across banking, public sector, and consulting environments.Experienced in delivering end-to-end data engineering solutions using Snowflake, Databricks, AWS, Informatica IDMC/IICS/PowerCenter, and SQL, integrating data from enterprise databases, APIs, SFTP, and file-based sources into governed data warehouse and data mart environments.My experience spans batch data ingestion, ETL/ELT, source-to-target mapping, data transformation, dimensional modeling, data quality validation, automated reconciliation, orchestration, pipeline monitoring, and production support. I have worked across medallion-style data architectures, transforming and validating data through curated layers before delivering trusted datasets into Snowflake for downstream analytics and regulatory reporting.I also have experience modernizing legacy ETL processes, developing reusable integration patterns, optimizing SQL and data workloads, and implementing data quality, lineage, metadata, access control, and masking practices within regulated environments.I work closely with business, risk, finance, application, and engineering teams to translate data requirements into reliable and scalable data solutions while supporting production stability and regulatory requirements.Core Expertise• Snowflake &amp; Databricks• Informatica IDMC, IICS &amp; PowerCenter• AWS S3, Glue &amp; Lambda• SQL &amp; Data Transformation• ETL/ELT &amp; Enterprise Data Integration• Batch &amp; Incremental Data Pipelines• REST API, SFTP &amp; File-Based Ingestion• Data Warehousing &amp; Dimensional Modeling• Data Quality &amp; Automated Reconciliation• Orchestration, Monitoring &amp; Production Support• Data Governance, Metadata &amp; Lineage• Banking &amp; Regulated Data Platforms","Developed and supported enterprise batch data pipelines integrating source systems through Informatica and AWS S3, applying transformation and validation logic in Databricks and delivering curated datasets into Snowflake data warehouse and regulatory data marts.
• Worked across EDAG and medallion-style data layers, supporting data ingestion, transformation, validation, source-to-target mapping, and downstream delivery for banking, finance, and risk data.
• Implemented automated SQL-based data quality and source-to-target reconciliation checks, including record counts, duplicate detection, null validation, key-integrity checks, and business-rule validation, reducing manual reconciliation effort by approximately 35%.
• Supported batch and incremental processing, pipeline dependencies, production monitoring, troubleshooting, restart/recovery, and resolution of failed or delayed data loads.
• Performed SQL profiling and query optimization and supported performance improvements across Databricks and Snowflake workloads.
• Built reusable ingestion and onboarding patterns for enterprise data sources including APIs, SFTP, and file-based feeds.
• Applied RBAC, masking, data quality, metadata, and lineage controls to support secure and governed data processing in a regulated banking environment.
• Worked with Finance, Risk, IT, application, and engineering teams to translate data requirements into reliable source-to-target data flows and downstream datasets.
Data Governance & Metadata
• Supported UOB's EDAG data governance framework through data ownership, stewardship, metadata management, lineage, and data quality practices.
• Worked with Collibra for business glossary, metadata standards, asset classification, lineage documentation, and governance workflows.
• Supported governance controls aligned with enterprise data management practices and regulatory requirements.",,,"Singapore, Singapore",4 years 2 months in role,4 years 2 months in company,,,,,,2nd,https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQEEPH--Wuh4Yg/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B56ZxxX1c_GoAI-/0/1771428600357?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=TOd3YhrYs5wVFqqiun4kvIFPtsEEkm_E-gGjZfDxiGE,0,Yasmeen Shaikh,ACwAABv27_IB6XNws2YWnymG3JUkdNf55NkkoJU,https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACwAABv27_IB6XNws2YWnymG3JUkdNf55NkkoJU/,false,false,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A4514659529%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3AREGION%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A102454443%2Ctext%3ASingapore%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_TITLE%2Cvalues%3AList((text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architects%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A204%2Ctext%3ASolutions%2520Architect%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solutions%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2732%2Ctext%3AData%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A25206%2Ctext%3AMachine%2520Learning%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522ML%2520Engineer%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A340%2Ctext%3AData%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2463%2Ctext%3ASenior%2520Data%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253AsalesList%253A7501538601336471552%2Ctext%3ADB-sav%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED%2Cicon%3Alist)))))&sessionId=65dqqVOtRgeTQWPyQd47hA%3D%3D&viewAllFilters=true,2026-09-04T07:37:48.199Z,https://linkedin.com/in/shaikhyasmeen,436910035,Syed Waris Iqbal
