"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAAA5hspwBPEvvKx8EuwnBiuTijYFDlE589fQ,NAME_SEARCH,gfjz",Chia Voon LEONG,Chia Voon,LEONG,Sembcorp Industries Ltd,"Assistant Manager, Market Digital – SG & SEA (Solution Architect & Full-Stack Engineer)",45161,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/company/45161,https://www.linkedin.com/company/45161,"I design the systems, build them, and own the conversation with the people who depend on them.Sixteen years across enterprise manufacturing, payments, cloud consulting and digital agencies has given me an unusually wide stack — Java/JEE, PHP and .NET through Azure infrastructure to every generation of front-end. That breadth is the point: I can size a solution honestly, because I've had to maintain most of the choices I'd be recommending.At Sembcorp I work on energy market systems, where I'm currently leading a re-architecture of a landscape that grew as point-to-point integrations — replacing duplicated, inconsistent connections with a centralised data hub that validates once and serves downstream systems cleanly. I've also delivered a production route optimisation platform planning over 2,000 trips a month as sole technical owner, and a pipeline consolidating contracts and consumption forecasts into the exposure calculations our risk team hedges against.Alongside that, I introduced coding agents to my team and redesigned the engineering process around them — context gathering, planning, steering, feedback loops, human-in-the-loop review. The interesting problem isn't using agents; it's working out where their judgment can be trusted and where a human has to stay in the path. I'd rather be shaping how a team answers that than catching up to it.Earlier, I led front-end teams at Samsung SDS, where I drove the migration from SVN to Git and introduced automated code quality analysis, and ran Azure cloud and DevOps consulting for APAC marketing stakeholders.","Solution architect and hands-on engineer across the energy market systems portfolio, owning design through delivery and working directly with business stakeholders.

Data platform re-architecture (current)
 • Leading the re-architecture of a fragmented energy market systems landscape, replacing repeated point-to-point integrations with a centralised data hub that validates and normalises data before serving downstream systems — improving data quality, traceability, consistency and long-term maintainability across the estate.
 
Energy position & hedging pipeline
 • Designed and built a system consolidating customer contracts and forecasted consumption into aggregated exposure calculations feeding the hedging platform used by the risk team.
 • Built on C#/.NET, Next.js, Azure and MS SQL.
 
Route optimisation platform
 • Sole technical owner — architecture, implementation and stakeholder management — for a production route optimisation and operations management system planning 2,000+ collection trips monthly, replacing a manual planning process.
 • Built on C#/.NET, Blazor, Azure and MS SQL.
 
Engineering practice
 • Introduced coding agents to a team of 10 and redesigned the surrounding engineering process — context gathering, planning, agent steering, feedback loops, asynchronous agent execution and human-in-the-loop review — improving product quality and reducing delivery time.
• Go-to technical advisor for the team on solution architecture and design decisions.",Utilities,"Singapore, Singapore","Singapore, Singapore",1 year 11 months in role,1 year 11 months in company,,,,,,3rd,,0,Chia Voon LEONG,ACwAAA5hspwBPEvvKx8EuwnBiuTijYFDlE589fQ,https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACwAAA5hspwBPEvvKx8EuwnBiuTijYFDlE589fQ/,false,false,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A4514659529%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3AREGION%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A102454443%2Ctext%3ASingapore%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_TITLE%2Cvalues%3AList((text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architects%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A204%2Ctext%3ASolutions%2520Architect%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solutions%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2732%2Ctext%3AData%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A25206%2Ctext%3AMachine%2520Learning%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522ML%2520Engineer%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A340%2Ctext%3AData%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2463%2Ctext%3ASenior%2520Data%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253AsalesList%253A7501538601336471552%2Ctext%3ADB-sav%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED%2Cicon%3Alist)))))&sessionId=65dqqVOtRgeTQWPyQd47hA%3D%3D&viewAllFilters=true,2026-09-04T07:37:48.199Z,https://linkedin.com/in/leongcv,436910035,Syed Waris Iqbal
"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAAFqCJIgBiN-Wb4TX0P9G6lyhOq4LLYQjR98,NAME_SEARCH,A8zU",Jayden Kurian,Jayden,Kurian,OCBC,Data Engineer - Intern,165277,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/company/165277,https://www.linkedin.com/company/165277,"I’m Jayden, a student at Singapore Polytechnic currently pursuing a Diploma in Applied AI and Analytics. I’m passionate about working with data to uncover insights that drive smarter decisions and solve meaningful problems. My interest lies in applying analytics and AI techniques to real-world challenges, and I enjoy the process of turning raw data into useful, actionable information.Through my studies, I’ve gained experience in data analytics, machine learning, Python programming, and SQL. I enjoy exploring and cleaning datasets, building models, and creating visualizations that help people better understand complex information. I take a problem-solving approach to my work, with a focus on accuracy and attention to detail.Outside the classroom, I’m a competitive kayak sprint athlete — a sport that has taught me discipline, resilience, and the value of consistent hard work. The dedication required in training and competition directly translates to my studies and projects: staying focused under pressure, working toward long-term goals, and continuously improving through feedback and iteration.I’m also committed to continuous learning. I actively seek out new tools, technologies, and concepts through online courses and self-driven projects to deepen my understanding of AI and analytics. I believe learning never stops, and I’m excited to keep growing as the field evolves.If you’re looking for someone who is curious, proactive, and passionate about data — and who brings the same determination from the kayak sprint course into the workplace — I’d be glad to connect.","Selected for OCBC’s Ignite (Tech) programme, working as a Data Engineer intern within the Group Data Office. Contributing to data-driven initiatives by supporting the design, development, and optimisation of data pipelines and workflows.",Banking,"Singapore, Singapore","Singapore, Singapore", 7 months in role, 7 months in company,,,,,,3rd,https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQHfWeOgHYixlA/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B56Zg700BjHQAI-/0/1753350422795?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=_5IDpd_lQxpcKb-jTutKVmND5sY6pzt7UjMr1eVuya4,0,Jayden Kurian,ACwAAFqCJIgBiN-Wb4TX0P9G6lyhOq4LLYQjR98,https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACwAAFqCJIgBiN-Wb4TX0P9G6lyhOq4LLYQjR98/,false,false,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A4514659529%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3AREGION%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A102454443%2Ctext%3ASingapore%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_TITLE%2Cvalues%3AList((text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architects%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A204%2Ctext%3ASolutions%2520Architect%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solutions%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2732%2Ctext%3AData%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A25206%2Ctext%3AMachine%2520Learning%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522ML%2520Engineer%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A340%2Ctext%3AData%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2463%2Ctext%3ASenior%2520Data%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253AsalesList%253A7501538601336471552%2Ctext%3ADB-sav%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED%2Cicon%3Alist)))))&sessionId=65dqqVOtRgeTQWPyQd47hA%3D%3D&viewAllFilters=true,2026-09-04T07:37:48.199Z,https://linkedin.com/in/jayden-kurian,436910035,Syed Waris Iqbal
