"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAABlCVFsBiW5kULIpTCtIB9RzUZqggNfPUX8,NAME_SEARCH,Gfmp",Yee Teng YEOH,Yee Teng,YEOH,Scoot,"Senior Analyst, Business Intelligence (Business Intelligence & Analytics)",2383488,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/company/2383488,https://www.linkedin.com/company/2383488,"I'm a passionate data analyst with years of experience across technology, finance, and electronics, specializing in leveraging data analysis to identify business trends, solve complex problems, and deliver excellence results.

Being detail-oriented and proficient in advanced Excel, SQL, Python, machine learning, and dashboarding, I develop, design and create efficient solutions that improve productivity and performance. For example, my structured and accurate analysis led to savings of S$4,000,000 per year by cutting wastage refund costs (cost avoidance).

I’m strongly focused on efficiency and automating processes to save time, whether through Excel macros or Python scripts. This reduces manual errors and frees up time for more important tasks and strategic initiatives.

I’m fluent in English, Mandarin, Malay, Hokkien, and Cantonese, with basic proficiencies in French and Korean, enabling me to effectively present and communicate actionable insights to diverse stakeholders.

Outside of work, I enjoy logic games like Sudoku and building custom Excel programs for personal projects, such as tracking bills, utility usage, and household inventory management.

As a lifelong learner, I dedicate at least 10 minutes each day to continuous self-improvement and strive to foster growth in others. I believe that collaborative effort is essential to achieve collective success.

Feel free to reach out if you'd like to connect. I am confident in my ability to deliver value through data-driven solutions.

