2. Provide the data in both Data Warehouse and Relational DB for our Spend System (cardholder is eligible to enjoy spend tiers that contain some benefits)

3. Improve the privileged users' experience and speed up their data processing. Design & implement a lambda architecture that includes both a daily batch pipeline and a streaming pipeline. When a batch job is completed, the batch result overwrites the overlapped realtime result.

4. Design & Develop an in-house data governance stack to improve data discovery and democratization. The data users can quickly find out where their target data locates and access it under their privilege: a.) Dataset Registry, a Data Catalog tool in Akka HTTP, supports a data pipeline to register its metadata. Its generic data model supports various kinds of pipelines (Spark Batch, Spark Streaming,  Kafka Connect, Python Script, etc.) and data sources, as well as the data lineage info. b.) Central Access Controller, a data security tool, supports tag-based ACL policy. It directly sets ACL at target Storage & Query Engines (e.g. Presto). c.) Use RAG and LLM to further improve the data discovery.

5. Release a self-serve batch data ETL framework that supports loading various kinds of raw data shared by different banks from data lake to the data warehouse. The framework user only needs to provide a Yaml file that includes all the details about the data ETL. An Airflow DAG and Spark apps are auto created based on the Yaml file. Spark apps do some generic data transformation, such as data formatting, common schema and glossary mapping, etc. Also, various kinds of data validations are applied. Finally, the result is loaded to the data warehouse.",,,"Singapore, Singapore",3 years 8 months in role,3 years 8 months in company,,,,,,3rd,https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5103AQGsdjgiC2zmUA/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1517354071726?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=QqPVPry87P8M9D42xrmhFRiOZBLwwuR41HdrwCuIhq0,0,Jintao Ye,ACwAAByGWsEBHpSkSHlMz5q25_GRGUb_jGuKd-0,https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACwAAByGWsEBHpSkSHlMz5q25_GRGUb_jGuKd-0/,false,false,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A4514659529%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3AREGION%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A102454443%2Ctext%3ASingapore%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_TITLE%2Cvalues%3AList((text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architects%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A204%2Ctext%3ASolutions%2520Architect%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solutions%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2732%2Ctext%3AData%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A25206%2Ctext%3AMachine%2520Learning%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522ML%2520Engineer%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A340%2Ctext%3AData%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2463%2Ctext%3ASenior%2520Data%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253AsalesList%253A7501538601336471552%2C