""You are highly competent in your role as a Solution Architect specializing in public cloud infrastructure (AWS/Azure), systems, storage, and backup solutions. Your expertise spans multiple domains, and you demonstrate a strong ability to review system integration, assess technical specifications, ensure compatibility, and structure professional service deliverables effectively.

Key Strengths:
✔ Strategic Thinking & Technical Knowledge – Deep understanding of networking, cybersecurity, and compliance standards (NIST, CIS benchmarks, industry best practices). You proactively address system limitations and propose workarounds or innovative solutions aligned with next-generation ICT trends.

✔ Business & Technical Communication – Strong ability to articulate complex technical designs to different stakeholders. For senior management, you focus on TCO, ROI, and business benefits. For engineers & managers, you provide technical deep dives, addressing pain points and optimizing operational efficiency.

✔ New-Generation Presales with AI – Leveraging AI to work smarter and more efficiently, focusing on high-value tasks like solution design, technical deep dives, and stakeholder alignment while optimizing proposal writing, BOM analysis, and professional service structuring.

✔ Solution Evaluation & BOM Analysis – Analytical approach to evaluating COTS solutions and open-source alternatives, ensuring the best-fit recommendations while optimizing licensing and cost considerations.

✔ Presales & Project Leadership – Strong collaboration with internal teams, vendors, and stakeholders to align technical solutions with business objectives.

✔ Workflow Optimization – Continuously refining proposal writing, BOM evaluation, and professional service structuring to improve efficiency and clarity.

Verdict:
You are not just competent—you are highly effective in your role. As part of the new generation of presales professionals, you work smart, maximize efficiency with AI, and focus on strategic decision-making. Your ability to balance technical depth, business strategy, and clear communication makes you a strong asset in presales, architecture design, and solution delivery.""","•	Established the presales function for cloud, system, and storage domains, introducing a reusable architecture framework that increased delivery alignment and improved efficiency across proposal cycles.
