•	Contributed to technical and commercial tender responses, including BOMs, Professional Services and Managed Services SoWs, effort sizing, compliance mapping, and risk considerations.
•	Applied AI selectively to improve solution research and professional writing, accelerating content generation while ensuring technical accuracy and contextual alignment.
•	Designed and supported cloud workloads, hybrid infrastructure, storage lifecycle planning, and data protection strategies tailored to different operational maturity levels.
•	Collaborated with Sales, Delivery, Vendor, and SME teams to ensure technical proposals were well-integrated, commercially viable, and aligned to both client needs and delivery feasibility.
•	Engaged in rapid-response scenarios for unsolicited tenders and vendor-led opportunities, reshaping misaligned specifications into more optimized, scalable, and cost-effective alternatives.
•	Partnered with strategic accounts on budget planning, presales advisory, and tender shaping to support long-term client growth and architecture evolution.
•	Delivered solution walkthroughs, bid clarifications, and proposal documents with clarity, balancing business intent with compliance and implementation considerations.
•	Maintained a practical, team-oriented working style, contributing to presales governance by flagging delivery readiness, ensuring architecture resilience, and supporting solution consistency across projects.",Telecommunications,"Singapore, Singapore",Singapore,5 years 4 months in role,5 years 4 months in company,,,,,,3rd,https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5103AQGTF7tOtHM7Vg/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1516861735572?e=1790208000&v=beta&t=8F_fEUpgyeZrNyPbKAU9QBnqC6ZCmPaAdDA2CPfRdwg,0,Arthur Lim,ACwAAB3GDXwB7dfEtAOpGYBlv8cvr81eUvkkjd4,https://www.linkedin.com/in/ACwAAB3GDXwB7dfEtAOpGYBlv8cvr81eUvkkjd4/,false,false,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A4514659529%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3AREGION%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A102454443%2Ctext%3ASingapore%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_TITLE%2Cvalues%3AList((text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architects%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A204%2Ctext%3ASolutions%2520Architect%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solution%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522Solutions%2520Architect%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2732%2Ctext%3AData%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A25206%2Ctext%3AMachine%2520Learning%2520Engineer%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(text%3A%2522ML%2520Engineer%2522%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A340%2Ctext%3AData%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)%2C(id%3A2463%2Ctext%3ASenior%2520Data%2520Analyst%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))%2C(type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253AsalesList%253A7501538601336471552%2Ctext%3ADB-sav%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED%2Cicon%3Alist)))))&sessionId=65dqqVOtRgeTQWPyQd47hA%3D%3D&viewAllFilters=true,2026-09-04T07:42:05.953Z,https://linkedin.com/in/arthur-lim-cy,436910035,Syed Waris Iqbal
