I have hands-on experience with SQL, Python (pandas, numpy, seaborn, matplotlib, scikit-learn), and Power BI/DAX for analytical modeling and dashboarding); and workflow automation using tools like Power Automate and UiPath. My background as a data engineering intern and university projects strengthened my foundations in statistics, data management, and reproducible practices (Git), while my interpersonal skills and stakeholder management enable me to translate business questions into technical requirements, collaborate with cross-functional teams, and present insights to non-technical audiences.

