My academic path led me to explore the realms of technology and business. I hold an undergraduate degree in Information System Studies and a Master's in Business Analytics. These disciplines have been the cornerstone of my professional journey, equipping me with a robust foundation to navigate the complex world of data and analytics.

💼 Decade of Expertise in Technology and Data
