"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAAA3k8EYBgKf_1Xv57NQ50woa7xKOuJ-mfqw,NAME_SEARCH,wjd-",Kyi Win Tun (Kevin),Kyi Win,Tun (Kevin),UOB,Data Analyst and Assistant to Data Steward,6883,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/company/6883,https://www.linkedin.com/company/6883,"I am a data analyst specialized in data analytics, business intelligence, web application development and system/business analysis. I am a self motivated person who wants to learn new things.","-	Act as Assistant to the Data Steward for the enterprise Data Lake EDAG (Hadoop environment), supporting governance, access control, and daily operations.
-	Serve as the primary point of contact for data access requests from all Business Units (BUs), including overseas subsidiaries, reviewing requests, ensuring required approvals, and assigning tasks to the team in my capacity as team lead.
-	Maintain and govern the Data Discovery Store (DDS) SOP, providing guidance and explanations to users and subsidiaries as required.
