-	Manage end-to-end communication with BUs and subsidiaries, including issue resolution, complaints handling, and clarification of data-related matters.
-	Coordinate quarterly user access reviews and sign-offs with BU senior management to ensure compliance with governance and audit requirements.
-	Support internal and external audits by explaining data processes, responding to auditor queries, and preparing required evidence and artefacts.
-	Interpret and enforce bank-wide data policies, including Cross-Border Data Policy, PDPA, Data Export Policy, and Data Sharing Policy, advising BUs on compliance requirements.
-	Collaborate closely with Group Technology to raise Change Requests (CRs) for the Data Discovery Store environment, manage UAT activities, and obtain final sign-off.
-	Design and develop a rule-based risk analytics dashboard to monitor potentially malicious queries, proactively escalating risks when necessary.
-	Oversee daily operational activities including system housekeeping, storage capacity management, user onboarding/offboarding, data export requests, and challenging non-compliant requests when required.
-	Develop and maintain a holistic understanding of Data Lake systems and architecture, enabling effective advisory support to Business Units on data access, usage, and best practices.
