"https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAABk8dI0BBnBNDONgka4UxnHB1HwdphzEBjQ,OUT_OF_NETWORK,uM33",ZHE CHENG GOH,ZHE CHENG,GOH,Singtel,Data Analyst,5334,https://www.linkedin.com/sales/company/5334,https://www.linkedin.com/company/5334,"I’m a Data Analyst with 8 years of experience in procurement analytics, business intelligence, dashboard development, and reporting automation. In my current role at Singtel, I support analysis of approximately $8B in annual spend, build dashboards used by more than 5 teams, and automate recurring reporting processes that save around 50 hours per month. I also reduced refresh and report preparation time by 70% by streamlining data extraction, cleansing, and reporting workflows. Beyond reporting, I am spearheading the development of a centralized data lake, harmonizing 20 data sources into a single platform to improve data consistency, accessibility, and scalability for analytics. I also lead UAT and end-to-end project management for data initiatives, coordinating stakeholders, testing, issue resolution, and delivery to ensure solutions meet business requirements. My core tools include Power BI, SQL, Python, Databricks, Excel, Power Query, and PowerBI. I’m particularly interested in procurement analytics, data transformation, BI solution delivery, and turning complex business needs into practical analytics outcomes.","Spearhead the development of a centralized procurement data lake, harmonizing 20 data sources into a single platform to improve data consistency, accessibility, and scalability for reporting and analytics.
Lead user acceptance testing (UAT) and end-to-end project management for data and reporting initiatives, coordinating requirements, test planning, stakeholder alignment, issue resolution, and delivery.
