Let's connect and explore how data can create new opportunities! 🚀","As a Data Engineer, I specialize in designing and implementing scalable data solutions using Microsoft Azure and Databricks. My role involves working on end-to-end data pipelines, real-time data streaming, and automation to drive data-driven decision-making.

Key projects and responsibilities:
1. PSA Event Hub – Integrated Azure Event Hub with Streaming Analytics and Cosmos DB to enable real-time data processing and insights.

2. Global Data Analytics Platform (GDAP) – An end-to-end data analytics and machine learning platform designed to accelerate business insights and unlock new value from data. As a PSA-wide initiative, it empowers business units with advanced analytics tools, cost efficiencies, and operational synergy. Each unit receives a dedicated, self-administered space within GDAP, supported by DFE, similar to having their own floor within a shared building.

3. Power Automate & Power BI – Automated workflows and built interactive dashboards to enhance data accessibility and reporting.

Currently, I am deepening my expertise in Databricks to develop end-to-end solutions on the next-gen Lakehouse platform, further enhancing data processing efficiency and analytics capabilities.

